        "collapsible_tab_W7etYx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Origin:</strong> USA</p><p><strong>Main Color:</strong> White</p><p><strong>Material:</strong> Made with Certified Organic Cotton, Made with Certified Organic Wool,  Certified Organic Latex, Steel Coils, Always Toxin-FREE</p><p><strong>Mattress Depth:</strong> 13\" Depth</p><h3>Top Comfort Layer</h3><ul><li>Cotton Cover and Wool Base Layer</li><li><strong>Made with Certified</strong> <strong>Cotton</strong> Cover - Soft, breathable, and familiar against the skin (Cotton)</li><li><strong>Made with Certified Wool </strong>Base layer naturally disperses heat and moisture to regulate temperature (Wool)</li><li>Naturally flame-resistant without toxic chemicals (Wool)</li></ul><h3>Second Performance Layer</h3><ul><li><strong>4” Organic certified Latex </strong>Comfort</li><li>Soft, responsive comfort that gently contours to your body</li><li>Designed with breathable pinhole perforations to promote airflow</li><li>Does not sink and compress like foam</li></ul><h3>Foundation Support Layer</h3><ul><li>1100-Count 5-Zone Pocketed Steel Coil System<br/></li><li>Provides balanced, medium support to help maintain healthy alignment</li><li>Reinforced edge support for stability and full use of the mattress</li></ul><h3>Construction & Durability</h3><ul><li>Tufted construction to secure layers and maintain long-term performance without glues</li><li>Designed to hold shape and comfort over time</li><li><strong>30-Year Warranty (On craftsmanship and structural integrity)</strong></li><li><strong>100-Night Risk-Free Trial </strong><em>(30-day grace period)</em></li></ul>",
